"href=\"https://www.aboutads.info\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" "
"target=\"_blank\">aboutads.info</a> لإيقاف ملفات تعريف الارتباط لدى موردي "
"الطرف الثالث."
msgstr ""
"Você pode desativar a publicidade personalizada nas <a "
"href=\"https://adssettings.google.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" "
"target=\"_blank\">configurações de anúncios do Google</a> ou acessar <a "
"href=\"https://www.aboutads.info\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" "
"target=\"_blank\">aboutads.info</a> para desativar cookies de fornecedores "
"terceiros."

